<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Blended Endurance/Threshold/Sprints</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-6min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 18min @ 68% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 6min @ 91% FTP (Z4, RPE 6-7)
- 4min @ 70% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 6min @ 91% FTP (Z4, RPE 6-7)
- 1min @ 70% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 4 x (0:20 @ 200% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9) + 0:40 @ 50% FTP (Z1, RPE 3))
-Cadence: self-selected - Comfortable endurance cadence
-Position: Alternating - Alternate every 30 min: 30 min drops (aero) → 30 min hoods (power)

COOL-DOWN:
-3min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 1/6: Introductory - Focus on form and learning the workout pattern
-Aerobic base building. Easy riding builds mitochondrial density and fat oxidation—the foundation everything else rests on.

EXECUTION:
-Find your rhythm early -- I want long efforts broken into mental thirds.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="360" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="1080" Power="0.68" />
    <SteadyState Duration="360" Power="0.91" />
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="360" Power="0.91" />
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="20" Power="2.00" />
    <SteadyState Duration="40" Power="0.50" />
    <SteadyState Duration="20" Power="2.00" />
    <SteadyState Duration="40" Power="0.50" />
    <SteadyState Duration="20" Power="2.00" />
    <SteadyState Duration="40" Power="0.50" />
    <SteadyState Duration="20" Power="2.00" />
    <SteadyState Duration="40" Power="0.50" />
    <Cooldown Duration="180" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>